{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22201","headline":"读谢灵运诗 · 白居易","name":"读谢灵运诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾闻达士道，穷通顺冥数。\n通乃朝廷来，穷即江湖去。\n谢公才廓落，与世不相遇。\n壮志郁不用，须有所泄处。\n泄爲山水诗，逸韵谐奇趣。\n大必笼天海，细不遗草树。\n岂惟玩景物，亦欲摅心素。\n往往即事中，未能忘兴谕。\n因知康乐作，不独在章句。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}